Remote Desktop

Remote Desktop allows an authorized user or IT technician to remotely connect to and interact with a Windows computer.

Common RDP Port
TCP 3389
Example
IT Technician
      ↓
Remote Desktop
      ↓
User's Windows Computer
Quick Assist

Quick Assist is a Windows tool that allows a support person to remotely assist another user with their computer.

RDP vs Quick Assist
RDP
↓
Remote Desktop Connection

Quick Assist
↓
Remote Assistance

Both can be used for remote support, but they serve different purposes.
